### ============================================
### 9. CACHE TESTING
### ============================================
### Run same request twice to see cache effect

### First Request (Cache Miss)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### Second Request (Cache Hit - should be faster)
GET {{baseUrl}}/products

### ============================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================
### 1. Update @sessionId variable with actual session ID from responses
### 2. Update @productId with a valid product ID from your database
### 3. Update @orderId with actual order ID after creating an order
### 4. Make sure backend server is running on port 3000
### 5. Ensure PostgreSQL and Redis are running
### 6. Install "REST Client" extension in VS Code to use this file
### 7. Click "Send Request" above each request to execute
### 8. View responses in VS Code's output panel

